\f0\fs36 \cf0 Iron Ass Dark Retro vol.2.OXP
\fs26 \

\fs28 b3\
April 2022\

\fs26 \

\fs36 Brief
\fs26 \

\fs28 An OXP containing 10 \'93supporting cast\'94 classical ships from original Elite versions retextured in the retro Iron Ass style .\

\fs26 \

\fs36 Overview
\fs26 \

\fs28 This OXP contains 10 ships: the Bushmaster Miner, Chameleon, Cougar, Ghavial, Gnat, Iguana, Monitor, Ophidian, Salamander and the Wolf Mk.II. \
\
All but 2 (the Bushmaster and Gnat) are player-available ships.\

\fs26 \

\fs36 Background
\fs26 \

\fs28 This OXP is a reboot of models I made nearly 15 years ago (except for the Gnat) released in the oldships.oxp (2006), and very little was altered from the old models, but the texturing is radically different, here made to fit with the near black and white, dark metallic anaemic and uniform Iron Ass concept. \

\fs26 \

